\n▶생활편의 : 위례스타필드시티, 가락공판장, 트랜짓몰 등등 각종 행정/편의시설 多\n\n────────────────────\n황제공인중개사사무소\n☎ [phone removed]\n☎ [phone removed]\n\n#법무법인 해승 이사 역임\n- 재개발, 재건축, 토지수용, 법인회생 담당\n#RTN 부동산 경제TV 전문위원 역임\n#이데일리TV 부동산연구소 전문위원 역임\n#SBS CNBC 부동산 따라잡기 전문위원 역임\n────────────────────","addr":"경기도 하남시 위례대로6길 20","jibun":"경기도 하남시 학암동 652","lat":37.485507,"lng":127.152116,"imgs":["https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/886a51b0-7c82-4207-a2f7-ac5c710a78e8","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/1be103c1-5446-4e14-a738-853d174a3c20","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/cf463ce1-ffa7-4348-b5e9-f8ef040a1754","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/6c629d1a-2ee8-4785-92a3-319de48923ca","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/1942c233-fd3f-4768-98e3-ad6c71ef614f","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/2b7f9b27-6c68-4c23-b6fd-fd44b6a28579","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/d5789161-5271-463b-91ec-0705bc9cdd69","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/b00af83f-77ff-40d1-948c-80848f06ab27","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/a7ea2b85-7c6f-4151-8529-f8c351a5c0eb","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/153ba9f3-3edb-42d3-ba3f-56149581d213","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/24ae6ba4-6c93-4c56-96b6-5b05a4a28b99","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/783caaa3-9128-4294-a3a7-4872e7402ffe","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/19ad6623-2dcf-4cb6-8b9b-90c2107b5d14","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/3b3b950e-0a19-47a5-ad75-0fb3344b53f1","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/84bdf60b-3f0a-4bb1-aaf0-1a0f06154d4a","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/de505743-8cd1-448d-9b5d-3bfc8da34f77","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/dafaaab8-85c2-40e3-a76d-aeed7eb20def","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/d7b49baf-2d1b-47c6-a59b-5e3678e4be74","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/a2041f36-7004-44be-941c-49a3f42c1c3c","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/87af2b56-09c7-4335-8d4c-335c09177d52"],