\n5. 천정고 기존(2.3m)에 5cm 더높은 개방감\n6. 팬트리,현관창고등 넉넉한 수납공간\n7. 단지내 계양천, 수변공원 산책로 연결\n8.서울권 인접지로 출퇴근 매우 용이함\n9.인천1호선연장 101역 아라역개통 \n10.법원경찰청,롯데복합쇼핑몰,스마트위드업예정\n11.서울5,9호선,GTX노선등 교통호재","addr":"인천시 검단구 이음1로 173","jibun":"인천시 검단구 당하동 1314","lat":37.581651,"lng":126.712874,"imgs":["https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/f7b01cef-0cdf-4d08-a17a-d37f56eda63d","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/5bd287f4-36df-49c9-a932-8e4fb21f2060","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/1b951498-7e52-4861-a01b-1c7f882dc49f","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/844d9ac8-dccd-4985-b641-fd92d4d03a0f","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/01774d0a-c802-4ec0-adf6-07898e04e7c7","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/d77de292-af67-4c1c-8cee-bdda7e103a9e","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/7ec77c44-2826-48f4-a658-d157f04b4951","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/f3654ebb-c169-4e33-a196-e5ed1fcf99d1","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/aa9b8ab9-7ecd-418f-8c08-107d29fbe738","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/bdd3e6e1-b6df-408c-bdb9-34b80d7ed9ba","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/9f78fa5c-5067-4653-a862-2baf915b9fe3","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/8087a048-c983-4a55-bce0-4c1d6827487b","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/2a41967b-6710-499a-9fa4-65545aa5abd8","https://d1774jszgerdmk.cloudfront.net/1024/bd0abeb6-8f24-4687-956a-ed17e99533c8"],"facts":[["Exclusive size","84.73 m²"],["Supply size","109.2 m²"],["Rooms",3],["Bathrooms",2],["Floor","중층 of 25층"],["Facing","남"],["Layout","계단식"],["Parking","가능, 1.42 per unit"],["Move in","즉시 입주"],["Maintenance","25만원"],["Approved","2022.07.28"],["Households",1073],["Posted","2026.10.28"]],"opts":[],"tags":["주차"],"near":[["인천해든초등학교병설유치원","619 m"],["인천아람초등학교","692 m"],["인천아람초등학교병설유치원","695 m"],["인천아라초등학교병설유치원","906 m"]],"link":["Dabang","https://dabangapp.com/room/6ae19f9269887442e1e35ce8"],"station":["계양역 (공항철도,인천1호선)","2.3 km"]},"d:6acd78a4dc8ce805d258bb47":{"memo":"안녕하